WEBVTT

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.180
Miyuki!

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.480
Your dress is really cute-kuru!

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.370
Isn't it? It's called a yukata!

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.520
Miyuki!

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.990
You been waitin' long?

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.050
Akane-chan! Nao-chan!

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:20.030
You two look nice too!

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:21.760
You do-kuru!

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:27.130
I know, right? Finally got my dad to buy me this!

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:28.940
Hey, neat!

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:34.410
This isn't my usual style, so I'm not sure how well this suits me, but...

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.280
Aww, don't be silly! You look great!

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:38.660
Thanks!

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:40.210
Miyuki-chan!

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.880
Over here!

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:44.190
I must apologize for our delay.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.720
Wow, you two look really fantastic!

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:50.660
You look so pretty in that, Yayoi-chan!

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:51.560
Thanks!

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:55.530
And Reika's got that whole classy, traditional vibe goin' on.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.330
My mother advised me on the correct way to wear this.

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:00.730
I must say you all look splendid as well.

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:05.240
Miyuki! I want to wear my own yukata-kuru!

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:07.410
Use the Dress Décor-kuru!

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.440
Oh, right!

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:12.480
Let's Go: Dress!

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:15.950
How adorable!

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:20.120
Alright then! Let's make the most out of this festival!

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.880
Kuru!

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:27.420
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.260
Smile Precure!

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:30.160
Let's go!

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:31.690
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:32.830
All together!

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:34.430
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:36.630
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.300
Smile Precure!

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:44.140
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:49.580
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:54.780
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:55.520 --> 00:02:00.720
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:05.660
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:05.630
So bright!

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:10.830
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:17.270
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.770
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:18.940
Let's go!

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:21.640
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:24.580
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:29.380
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:29.950
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:31.620
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:32.750
Everybody!

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.420
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.960
Fly to the future!

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.460
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:42.630
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:44.930
Smile Precure!

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:55.680
Kuru...

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:05.150
Hey, Nao-chan! There's your dad!

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:08.050
Keep it up, Dad!

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:10.820
What is that-kuru?

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:12.030
It's a taiko drum.

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:16.010
Wow-kuru... There are so many new things to see here-kuru!

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:19.450
Well, this is your first time at a festival, Candy.

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:22.480
There's still a lot more fun stuff to do too!

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:24.710
There's lots of yummy things to eat!

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.880
And the pièce de résistance...

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.750
...the fireworks display!

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.560
What're fireworks-kuru?!

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:37.710
They shoot up into the sky and explode, and they make big glowy flowers of light in the sky!

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.060
Flowers...?!

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:40.760
Come on, let's get movin'!

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:44.330
Hooray!

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:53.810
Here, Candy!

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:55.440
What's this-kuru?

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:56.750
This is cotton candy!

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.450
You just eat it like <i>this...</i>

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:01.620
It's so sweet!

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:08.090
It is-kuru!

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:12.830
Thank you, come again!

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:19.340
This is really good! Better than my homemade poison apples, even-da wasa!

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:22.990
Still, when I came to check out this "festival" these humans are holding,

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:25.540
I wasn't expecting to see so many people-da wasa...

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:30.910
I can't wait to show them all the Bad End they—!

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.080
So then, right, my mom's all like...

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:36.550
The Precure are here?!

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:39.930
Kuru...

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:41.090
Here, Candy!

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:41.890
Kuru?

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:44.270
You use this to scoop up the goldfish.

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:46.200
Just don't let the paper tear!

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:48.930
I shall demonstrate the proper technique.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:50.870
Reika-chan...?

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.110
Whoa!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:02.690
You gone pro or somethin'?

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:04.510
We've got a real master goldfish scooper here!

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:06.980
This art was passed down to me by my grandfather.

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:08.880
Kuru...!

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:10.950
I wanna try too-kuru!

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:14.190
Candy!

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:15.220
Well done!

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:23.480
This is too hard-kuru!

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:24.630
Here.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:26.450
You only get one more go, though.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:27.740
Kuru!

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:29.400
Good luck, Candy!

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:30.770
Kuru!

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.510
I'm not letting those Precure outdo me-da wasa!

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.350
Just you watch-da wasa!

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:40.850
Whoa! Whoa!

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:45.220
Excellent! Now I've got you-da wasa!

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:48.220
Oh, you <i>do</i> look tasty-da wasa...

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:49.470
Excuse me, ma'am?

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:52.260
Goldfish aren't really meant to be eaten...

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:54.430
What, I can't even eat the things-da wasa?

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:57.470
What's the fun in catching them, then-da wasa?!

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:00.340
Alright, let's try the shooting game next!

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:01.700
Excuse me, Mister!

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:02.810
We wanna play!

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:04.160
You got it!

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.840
Nao, what're you doing-kuru?

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:10.450
We're trying to win things by shooting them down with these cork guns.

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:12.520
Just watch and learn!

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:16.510
There!

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:18.660
Alright!

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:19.960
Whoa...!

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:21.880
My turn now!

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:25.550
Right... there!

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:28.030
Gotcha!

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.000
Oh, bad luck.

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:34.340
But I hit it dead on!

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:37.140
Right, but the rule is you have to knock it clean over.

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.470
Aww, that sucks!

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:41.000
I wanna have a go-kuru!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.440
Sure!

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:45.150
Kuru.

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:47.120
Stay focused, Candy!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.620
I wanna win that elephant-kuru!

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:52.620
Alright, then, Candy! Ready, set...

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:57.130
Congratulations!

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.400
You've won these nattou gyouza caramel sweets!

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.800
T-Thanks very much...

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:03.410
Nice one, Candy!

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:05.640
But I wanted the elephant-kuru...

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:13.780
Nattou gyouza caramel sweets, eh? Well, I can win those too-da wasa!

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:20.750
What's wrong with you-da wasa? Why aren't you firing-da wasa?!

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:26.820
What's going on-da wasa?!

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:30.320
Congratulations, ma'am! You've won a vacation to Guam!

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:34.130
Gum? I don't want your stinkin' gum! I want my caramel sweets-da wasa!

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:41.010
And done.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:44.490
That's craftsmanship for ya!

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:46.080
It's a veritable work of art.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.280
Wow-kuru! What <i>are</i> they-kuru?

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.610
They're sugar sculptures!

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:51.780
Sugar? Then they're tasty-kuru...?

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:52.580
Yeah!

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:55.780
I take requests, if you want something in particular.

00:07:55.780 --> 00:08:01.800
Really? Well, could you make Can... I mean, uh, this plush!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.160
What a cute plush!

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:07.390
One second...

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:09.130
Yay-kuru!

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:15.800
Wow, it's really taking shape!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.310
One freshly made sculpture!

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:18.840
Thank you very much!

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:20.230
It's so cute!

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:22.440
I want it, I want it!

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:23.300
Here you go, then!

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.420
Oooh, fishing for water balloons!

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:34.090
Let's do it!

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:35.620
Alright, it's on!

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.220
Aww, crap!

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:42.570
Yay, I got one!

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:44.970
I got one too-kuru!

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:46.290
Nice!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.010
Whoa, Reika-chan!

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:51.910
You can do it!

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:00.630
Well, this has all been a big waste of time-da wasa!

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:04.620
I fail to see what's so fun about this whole festival thing-da wasa!

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:06.800
This is so good-kuru!

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:08.890
So, what next?

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:12.360
I say we go eat all the yummy foods we can!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:13.470
Sounds good to me!

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:14.560
Seconded!

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:16.600
I want some corn on the cob!

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.830
I would quite enjoy having some takoyaki again.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.540
Reika knows what's up!

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.500
Well, my vote's for yakisoba!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.740
There'll be time for all of them!

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.850
Say, Miyuki-san... where is Candy?

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:30.890
Hrm?

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:34.620
Huh? Wh-Wha—?

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:36.250
Candy?

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:37.950
Kuru...

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:39.660
They're kinda cute-kuru!

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:43.360
Oh my, I didn't realize I'd dropped another one here...

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:47.600
Wait... I don't remember having a toy like this... ah, well.

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:49.570
Kuru...

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:52.570
And a <i>heave-ho!</i>

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:00.980
This isn't good-kuru...

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:06.680
Sunny!

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:13.710
Candy!

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:20.700
Did you find her?

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:22.230
No luck.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:23.670
Where could she have gone?

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:27.040
That's not her over <i>there,</i> is it?

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:31.770
Candy!

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:37.810
It <i>is</i> Candy!

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:41.880
What do we do...?

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:46.590
It seems we have no choice but to win her back fair and square.

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:48.960
Fair and square?

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:51.430
It's 300 yen to play the game.

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:53.630
Alright! How much we all got?

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:56.310
100, 200...

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:57.990
We have exactly 300!

00:10:58.730 --> 00:11:02.540
Ya serious? All we can scrounge up is 300 measly yen?

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:05.770
Hint: It works better saying that if you have more than 20 left yourself.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:09.650
We get five chances to play, everyone!

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:12.210
So that's one each, then!

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:14.650
Let's work together and get Candy back!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:15.950
Yeah!

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:18.350
Hurry and save me-kuru...

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:20.660
If you'll excuse me...

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:22.690
...I, Aoki Reika...

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:24.090
...shall accept this duty!

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:25.560
Alright, Reika!

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:27.200
You can do it, Reika-chan!

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:38.810
That's a miss, I'm afraid.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:42.480
It appears ring tossing is a subtler art than I had foreseen.

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:43.880
The heck...

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:47.390
My turn now!

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:57.260
Congratulations, here you go!

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:00.530
I always wanted one of these!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:01.960
Lucky you!

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:03.830
Wrong one, doof!

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:06.070
Save me already-kuru...!

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.370
Alright, time to throw down the ringlet!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.240
Go get her, Nao-chan!

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:11.540
Here goes!

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:16.880
A bug?! Ewww!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.690
Is it raining-da wasa?

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:24.150
That's a miss.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.260
Nao-chan...

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:28.520
B-But...

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:31.730
Back off, guys, leave this one to me!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:35.300
Akane Super Ringtoss...

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:36.560
...Attack.

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:40.900
Perfect!

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:45.910
And that's a miss.

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:50.080
Aww, crap... Candy's head is too big for the ring!

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:54.980
My head isn't big at all-kuru! That ring's just too small-kuru!

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:58.990
Would this not mean our task is literally impossible?

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.490
It's all down to me...

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:03.690
Miyuki-chan...

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:11.690
Where'd those Precures go-da wasa?!

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.340
That's them!

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.810
Alright, Candy... let's give this a shot!

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:19.010
Kuru.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:34.160
I missed!

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:35.360
Wha—?!

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:45.610
Alright!

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:53.110
Here you go, Miss!

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:55.840
Thank you very much!

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:02.280
Miyuki!

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:03.760
Candy!

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:04.990
What a relief!

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.620
Stop right there-da wasa!

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:15.160
The heck are you doin' at our festival?!

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:19.370
I'm here to crush it like the flimsy excuse for an event it is-da wasa!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:22.400
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:25.370
...a Bad End-da wasa!

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:29.580
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-da wasa!

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:44.760
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot-da wasa!

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:51.730
Everyone was having so much fun until <i>you</i> showed up...

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:53.440
Come on, everybody!

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:54.200
Okay!

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.100
Ready?

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:02.520
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:03.410
Go!

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:06.300
Go, go!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.670
Let's go!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:39.040
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.010
Cure Happy!

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:46.850
Dazzling sun!

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:49.280
Hot-blooded power!

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:51.380
Cure Sunny!

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:57.370
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.110
Cure Peace!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:05.800
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:08.820
Cure March!

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:14.830
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.720
Cure Beauty!

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:22.370
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:32.800
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:37.510
You Precure really are a pain-da wasa...

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.880
Come on out, Super Akanbe!

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:46.050
Super Akanbe!

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:49.540
Super Akanbe, stomp those Precure into dust!

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:52.220
Super Akanbe!

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:55.360
Akan!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:00.030
We're not pulling any punches today-da wasa!

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:03.970
Peace!

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.470
Super!

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:09.550
We ain't prizes here, ya know!

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:13.180
I might have messed up my throw before, but this time's gonna be different!

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:16.380
Alright!

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:18.250
Akan...

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:22.110
Super Akanbe!

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:26.320
Don't throw them at <i>me</i>-da wasa!

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.080
What do you think you're doing-da wasa?!

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:32.560
Didn't you hear me? I gave you an order-da wasa!

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:33.760
Get me out of here!

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:35.660
Just a little more, Peace!

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:40.270
Super...!

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:43.510
Beauty! Peace!

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:45.480
Akanbe!

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:49.650
Super!

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:52.780
Good work, Super Akanbe-da wasa!

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:56.250
Why are you trying to ruin the festival?!

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:59.960
That stupid festival of yours is no fun at all-da wasa!

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:03.560
Getting wrecked and being left to a Bad End is about what it deserves-da wasa!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.900
You're not getting your way that easy!

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:09.270
Yeah, today's Candy's first time at a festival!

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.470
Why would you try and ruin that for her?!

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:16.740
These festivals are the highlight of summer, a memory to be savored!

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:19.210
And we will not let you ruin that for anyone!

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:21.750
Oh, quit your whining already-da wasa!

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:25.150
Super Akanbe! Finish them off, once and for all-da wasa!

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:28.080
Super Akanbe!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.790
Everybody's really enjoying this festival!

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:33.760
We won't let you steal that from them!

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:40.670
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.290
Princess Happy!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.390
Princess Sunny!

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:01.860
Princess Peace!

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:04.090
Princess March!

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:06.500
Princess Beauty!

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:13.870
Precure: Princess Form!

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:24.490
May the light of hope shine!

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:27.460
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:34.260
Precure...

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:40.540
Rainbow Burst!

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:48.490
Akanbe...!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:57.280
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:12.590
That makes six new Décors!

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:17.430
Well, that's the last time <i>I</i> go to a festival-da wasa!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.400
Now, let's get back to having fun!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.870
Hey, Miyuki-chan, it'll be starting soon!

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.600
Oh, right!

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:28.770
Kuru?

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:31.140
Time for the fireworks!

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:36.680
This is where the festival <i>really</i> gets going!

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:40.580
Yeah, the fireworks display is about to start!

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.590
I can't wait to see these fireworks-kuru!

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:10.210
Well, Candy, these are fireworks.

00:21:11.150 --> 00:21:12.830
They're so pretty-kuru...

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:42.340
It's really... as in really, <i>really...</i>

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:47.050
...just like humungous flowers are blooming in the sky-kuru!

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:03.790
I'm so ultra happy we can all watch the fireworks together!

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:41.540
Grandma, we've come to visit!

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:43.300
The food here is so good!

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:44.910
And the view is amazing!

00:23:44.910 --> 00:23:47.040
Whoa! This river's freezin' cold!

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:48.510
Just the place to find kappa monsters!

00:23:48.510 --> 00:23:49.880
I wanna meet a kappa-kuru!

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:54.420
My Grandma keeps telling me she has a really precious treasure she keeps up here...

00:23:54.420 --> 00:23:56.620
But what could it be...?

00:23:57.470 --> 00:23:58.890
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:04.470
Find your ultra happy smile!
